{"duration": 19.25, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 4.9, "text": "Two years earlier, in False Bay beside\nCape Town, divers had a favourite"}, {"start": 4.9, "end": 9.6, "text": "reef. On a good dive they could count\nup to 70 of these sevengill sharks"}, {"start": 9.6, "end": 13.96, "text": "there. Sevengills are smaller sharks\nthat hunt close to the seabed."}, {"start": 13.96, "end": 19.25, "text": "On the ninth of November\n2015, the divers found none."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.26, "text": "Two"}, {"start": 0.26, "end": 0.52, "text": "years"}, {"start": 0.52, "end": 1.16, "text": "earlier,"}, {"start": 1.48, "end": 1.64, "text": "in"}, {"start": 1.64, "end": 1.94, "text": "False"}, {"start": 1.94, "end": 2.26, "text": "Bay"}, {"start": 2.26, "end": 2.66, "text": "beside"}, {"start": 2.66, "end": 2.94, "text": "Cape"}, {"start": 2.94, "end": 3.4, "text": "Town,"}, {"start": 3.84, "end": 4.06, "text": "divers"}, {"start": 4.06, "end": 4.36, "text": "had"}, {"start": 4.36, "end": 4.56, "text": "a"}, {"start": 4.56, "end": 4.9, "text": "favourite"}, {"start": 4.9, "end": 5.3, "text": "reef."}, {"start": 5.84, "end": 6.0, "text": "On"}, {"start": 6.0, "end": 6.12, "text": "a"}, {"start": 6.12, "end": 6.32, "text": "good"}, {"start": 6.32, "end": 6.78, "text": "dive"}, {"start": 6.98, "end": 7.12, "text": "they"}, {"start": 7.12, "end": 7.26, "text": "could"}, {"start": 7.26, "end": 7.58, "text": "count"}, {"start": 7.58, "end": 7.76, "text": "up"}, {"start": 7.76, "end": 7.98, "text": "to"}, {"start": 7.98, "end": 8.32, "text": "70"}, {"start": 8.32, "end": 8.56, "text": "of"}, {"start": 8.56, "end": 8.76, "text": "these"}, {"start": 8.76, "end": 9.26, "text": "sevengill"}, {"start": 9.26, "end": 9.6, "text": "sharks"}, {"start": 9.6, "end": 10.02, "text": "there."}, {"start": 10.54, "end": 11.12, "text": "Sevengills"}, {"start": 11.12, "end": 11.36, "text": "are"}, {"start": 11.36, "end": 11.74, "text": "smaller"}, {"start": 11.74, "end": 12.18, "text": "